      "motion": {
        "pattern": "video-in-view",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "poster-frame"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.title-text",
      "content": {
        "title": "Simulating the various eye conditions",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "Pick a condition and the scene changes right in front of you. There’s also a slider you can drag to watch the condition get worse over time. The early stages are subtle enough that you might not catch them at first, but by the end you’ll probably find yourself leaning toward the screen trying to make out things that were perfectly clear a minute ago."
          },
          {
            "text": "When you want to understand what you’re actually seeing, scroll down for a plain-language explanation of each condition, backed by medical references. There are also resources that may help, whether you’re learning for someone you care about or because some of what you just saw felt a little too familiar."
          }
        ],
        "highlight": "Simulating"
      },
